                    coach_header:           `Facilitator (CEO & the board)`,
                    coach_intro:            `You bought a knowledge platform in 2021 and nobody used it — because engineers are still rewarded only for shipping their own unit's features, never for sharing or reusing. A platform without aligned incentives dies, as you already proved. Diagnose which intellectual-capital gap actually binds, capture the fragile tacit knowledge before two more architects retire, concentrate your €5M rather than sprinkling it, and measure innovation output — not posts and café sessions.`,

