                    r3_incentive_hint:      `Too low and nothing flows (the 2021 failure); too high and engineers write wikis instead of shipping product.`,
                    r3_recognition_label:   `What behaviour do you actually reward and recognise?`,
                    rec_reuse:              `Reuse + impact — reward documented know-how that others demonstrably build on`,
                    rec_activity:           `Activity — reward platform posts, café sessions and documents filed`,
                    rec_shiponly:           `Leave it as is — keep rewarding only shipping your own unit's features`,
                    r3_protect_label:       `Protected time + curation ownership: how much €M to staff curation and free engineers' time?`,
                    r3_protect_hint:        `€M for curation roles, protected documentation/mentoring time and promotion-criteria redesign — adoption, not purchase, is what failed last time.`,
                    r3_safeguard_label:     `Safeguards so sharing lifts innovation rather than becoming the goal itself?`,
                    safe_outcome:           `Cap the sharing weight and gate it on innovation outcomes, not raw volume`,
                    safe_none:              `No safeguards — more sharing is always better, let it run`,

                    r4_shock:               `Mid-year shock: platform adoption is lagging and a senior architect has just announced early retirement. €1.0M of the budget is still uncommitted.`,
                    r4_redirect_label:      `How do you respond to the mid-year shock?`,
                    red_accelerate:         `Redirect funds to accelerate expert-capture before the architect leaves`,
