                    pitch_optimistic:       `Optimistic — emphasise the activity surge and project a fast rebound`,
                    pitch_buy:              `Concede — recommend the board pivot to buying innovation instead of building it`,
                    r4_conviction_label:    `Conviction: how firmly do you argue that mobilized knowledge beats vanity activity? (%)`,

